# Service category direction

This project is a **Service** industry vertical only (plumbing / home repair, Aquafix-style).

## Active category

- Sole category id: `Service` (`ACTIVE_CATEGORY` in `lib/types.ts`)
- Do **not** reintroduce a `Realestate` category or Buy/Rent/Sell property flows

## Homepage structure (Service)

Prefer this order (map existing section components; rename via JSON copy first):

1. Header + Hero (appointment CTAs, phone — not property search)
2. About + value props
3. Partners (reuse FeaturedDevelopers as partner logos)
4. Services grid (reuse IntroCategories / FeaturedProperties / ServicePage items as services)
5. Featured completed works (LatestProjects / Gallery)
6. Why choose us / benefits
7. Working process (PropertyProcess)
8. Testimonials
9. Team
10. Stats (CompanyStatistics)
11. FAQ
12. Blog
13. CTA (book appointment)
14. Contact + map
15. Footer

## Data rules

- **Category-specific** copy lives under `categories.Service`:
  - `sections`: Header, Banner, About, WhyChooseUs, Properties, FAQ, LatestProjects, FeaturedDevelopers, PropertyProcess, CompanyStatistics, ContactInfo, CitiesWeServe, InvestmentOpportunities
  - `pages`: InvestmentTipsPage, EmiCalculatorPage, AreaConverterPage, SellPage, ProjectsPage
- **Shared chrome** lives under `common`: Footer, Topbar, Testimonial, Team, AwardsPage, GalleryPage, CareerPage, legal pages, ContactPage, AboutPage, ServicePage, WhyChooseUsPage, etc.
- Do **not** duplicate Team / Testimonials / Awards / Footer under the category — edit `common.*`
- `Properties.listings` represent **service packages / offerings**, not homes
- Disable or reconfigure `Banner.smartSearch` for Service (no Buy/Rent defaults)
- Prefer JSON `buttons[].href` → `/services`, `/contact`, `/projects` over hardcoded `/properties`

## Visual direction

- Service brand palette: deep navy + bright lime accents
- Prefer CSS variables over hardcoded terracotta/cream when touching template-1
